## Gate

@guard{code="0010"}: Halt. What is the password?

::ask{slot="password"}

<match subject="scene.ask.password.answer">
  <when is="swordfish">
    @guard{code="0020"}: Pass, friend.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @guard{code="0030"}: Wrong. Move along.
  </otherwise>
</match>
